HAPSwift (vendored)

This directory contains a modified copy of hap-swift
(https://github.com/acumen-dev/hap-swift), licensed under the Apache License,
Version 2.0 (LICENSE.md). Copyright Monagle Pty Ltd and contributors.

Modifications for HomeRelay (2026-11): durable pairing and identity storage,
controller permissions, events to other controllers on writes, multi-frame
encrypted responses and HTTP reassembly, a persisted configuration number with
stable instance and accessory IDs, timed writes, corrected Bonjour TXT records
and a fixed port. HOMERELAY.md describes each change and how it was verified.
The Linux transport, the umbrella target and the demo were left out.
